    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon, See: @UUID[Compendium.dnd-dungeon-masters-guide.equipment.Item.dmgQuaalsFeather]{Quaal's Feather Token}</em></p><p>You must be outdoors to use this token. You can take a Magic action to touch it to an unoccupied space on the ground. The token disappears, and in its place a nonmagical oak tree springs into existence. The tree is 60 feet tall and has a 5-foot-diameter trunk, and its branches at the top spread out in a 20-foot radius.</p>",
